Subject: [PATCH 1/2]drivers/usb/core/sysfs.c Fix variable 'retval' set but not used
Date: Mon,  2 Aug 2010 21:26:28 -0700
Message-Id: <1280809589-23649-1-git-send-email-justinmattock@gmail.com>
